      "content": "it's not just \"hurt\" though. it's like the world has just closed its doors on me. i try to talk to people and it's like they're looking right through me. i'm essentially a non-person now. how am i supposed to just \"find support\" when there's literally nothing left to support? i'm just... done. there's no version of my life where this gets fixed.",
